  <prompt>ISS-020 is implemented by task 109, because a separate query for this half would re-introduce the two-snapshot hazard task 043 deliberately removed. Do not implement it again. Confirm task 109 delivered ISS-020's specific contract, record the evidence, and close #999.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer verifying a delivered authorization change against the register entry that asked for it.</role>
